// Karoryfer Lecolds libraries clean_guitar: clean electric guitar (Epiphone, flatwound strings, direct). Samples: Karoryfer Lecolds (Black And Green Guitars, Emily Guitar, Black And Blue Basses, D. Smolken double bass, Aliexpress Erhu, Swirly Drums), CC0 1.0 (https://github.com/sfzinstruments).
